composite-outcome descent and cross-residual descent.  Then
\begin{align*}
  \operatorname{COD}
  &\iff
  \mathcal O_U=\emptyset
  \iff
  \exists\,\bar U:Q_A\times Q_B\to Q_{AB},\
    \bar U(q_Aa,q_Bb)=q_{AB}(U(a,b)),\\
  \operatorname{CRD}
  &\iff
